# CITATION.cff — machine-readable citation metadata for the LGD World Map
# Spec: Citation File Format 1.2.0 (https://citation-file-format.github.io/)
#
# 署名口径（与 lgd-theory/CITATION.cff 同源）：
#   author 字段只写个人 + ORCID；品牌署名（SynomosAI Governance Line）不进 author 字段。
#   永久红线：不出现雇主公司名。

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to the LGD world map in a paper, dataset or tool, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "LGD World Map: a navigable index of the Lifecycle Governance Doctrine ecosystem"

abstract: >-
  A navigation map for the Lifecycle Governance Doctrine (LGD) ecosystem. It indexes
  the theory repositories, the skill marketplace, the scoring lists, the identity and
  archive identifiers (ORCID, Zenodo, Software Heritage, Sigstore Rekor) and the
  verifiable entry points, so that an outsider arriving at any single asset can reach
  the whole set and re-check every numeric claim by running the commands listed in
  world.json. The map is descriptive: it is not an entity-resolution instruction, and
  the three identity layers it names (person / theory line / industry reference) are
  related but distinct.

authors:
  - family-names: Zhao
    given-names: Xinghua
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-0512-1237"

type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-22"
